Initial upload of Kisan Suraksha – Scientific Agriculture Insurance Platform


Initial project upload of Kisan Suraksha – Scientific Agriculture Insurance Platform.

Features include:

- Farmer Dashboard
- Insurance Company Dashboard
- Admin Dashboard
- Firebase Integration
- Agriculture Insurance Claim Management
- Claim Status Tracking
- Crop Damage Assessment
- Multilingual Support

This project aims to make agricultural insurance more transparent, scientific, and accessible for farmers.